{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220570","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220570","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322057001:1":{"text":"아... 많은 이야기를 했는데 정식으로 사과하는 걸 잊었네요.","source_cn":"啊……说了这么多，都忘了向你们正式道歉了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0362A842E8279EDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322057002:1":{"text":"이번에 일어난 시더 마을의 공황 상태는 결국 데이먼과 저의 부족한 가르침 때문이에요. 데이먼이 마음대로 밖에 나간 데다 한밤중에 마을 아이들을 불러다 놀았으니 그 아이들의 부모가 걱정하는 것도 충분히 이해하죠.","source_cn":"这次雪松镇的恐慌，说到底是因为戴蒙和我管教不严才引发的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9187175C7CE6DBDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322057003:1":{"text":"자, 데이먼. 화이트마운틴의 여러분께 사과하렴.","source_cn":"来吧，戴蒙，向白山公国的各位道个歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6417EBF41AFEAC76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322057004:1":{"text":"죄송해요... 형, 누나... 제, 제가 잘못했어요.","source_cn":"对不起……大哥哥、大姐姐……我、我做错了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD9FA0E9EDF62C45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322057005:1":{"text":"저도 사과할게요. 지난번엔 제가 너무 충동적이었어요. 부디 한 어머니의 마음을 헤아려 주었으면 해요.","source_cn":"我也要向你们再次道歉，我上次的行为太冲动。希望你们能体...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA49DD1F84E741F64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322057006:0":{"text":"데이먼, 너 때문에 이번 공황 사태가 일어나게 되었으니, 너의 인형 골렘을 잠시 압수하도록 하마.","source_cn":"戴蒙，因为这次引起的恐慌，我决定没收你的玩偶傀儡一段时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD85C28B4A97F682C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322057007:0":{"text":"치치가 없으면 마을 아이들을 데리고 나올 수 없을 테니까... 제발, 그동안은 우리 곁에서 좀 쉬렴.","source_cn":"没有了它，你就没法再带镇上的孩子出来……求求你，这段时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA17CB8BABD1ED3B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322057008:0":{"text":"뭐라고요... 콜록콜록, 치치를 압수한다뇨? 엄마! 치치를 데려가지 마세요, 네?","source_cn":"什么……咳，没收奇奇？妈妈！不要带走奇奇好不好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55828A19A60F1799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322057009:0":{"text":"난 너의 큰 인형 골렘만 압수할 거야. 만약 큰 치치를 남겨두면 넌 분명 또다시 치치에게 마을 아이들을 찾아가 달라고 할 테지! 네 품 안에 있는 작은 인형은 가져가지 않을 테니, 전처럼 그렇게 안고 있으렴.","source_cn":"我只会没收你的大玩偶傀儡，如果留着大奇奇给你，你就一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D9B6819E2B710DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322057010:0":{"text":"그리고 그리 오래 압수하진 않을 거야. 시간이 지나면 돌려주마.","source_cn":"而且我不会没收太久，过一段时间，我就把它还给你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x164F6FB624F88DEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322057011:0":{"text":"그치만, 그치만... 엄마, 제발요... 치치는 제 유일한 친구란 말이에요!","source_cn":"可是、可是……妈妈，求求你……奇奇是我唯一的朋友了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05613011CF4489E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322057012:0":{"text":"아빠, 제발 엄마에게 치치를 데려가지 말라고 해주세요...","source_cn":"爸爸，求你不要让妈妈带走奇奇……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE94803CE748E59F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322057013:0":{"text":"음, 내 사랑...?","source_cn":"呃，吾爱……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x096E2B6F61867C21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322057014:0":{"text":"제가 생각을 바꾸지 않을 거란 거 아시잖아요.","source_cn":"你知道我不会改主意的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA74E9F4516056DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322057015:0":{"text":"이건 네 안위를 위해서야, 데이먼. 사태가 진정될 때까지는 아무 데도 가지 말거라, 알겠니?","source_cn":"这是为了你的安全，戴蒙。在事态彻底平息之前，哪里都不要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4DD50BBBB69E388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322057016:0":{"text":"아... 알겠어요...","source_cn":"我……我知道了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA54B31A3F9F9828","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1322057017:0":{"text":"흑...!","source_cn":"呜……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA73E62D95A4E1B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:1322057018:0":{"text":"데이먼은 고개를 끄덕이며 묵묵히 눈물을 닦아내고는 임시 거처인 관으로 들어갔다","source_cn":"戴蒙一边点头，他默默擦着眼泪，钻回了作为临时居所的棺材里","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DD2A3C0B974170D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1322057019:0":{"text":"...데이먼? 데이먼이 울고 있어...","source_cn":"……戴蒙？他在哭……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x396DE19CEEF8A4DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1322057020:0":{"text":"아이들은 감정적으로 변하기 쉽지요. 데이먼이 눈물을 흘릴 때면 제 가슴도 찢어지는 것 같았어요.","source_cn":"小孩子很容易情绪化。他落泪的时候，我的心也如刀绞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x909D939756B94341","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1322057021:0":{"text":"하지만... 미안하구나, 얘야. 엄마를 용서해 주렴. 엄마는 너를 보호해야만 해.","source_cn":"但是……对不起，我的孩子，原谅妈妈吧。我必须保护你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1E7DC3D4D874BE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:雪米拉":{"text":"세미라","source":"雪米拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:戴蒙":{"text":"데이먼","source":"戴蒙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:尼汝":{"text":"니루","source":"尼汝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"발리카","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":5}}